{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1791175484","published":"2026-10-05T04:45:00Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:31:54.173756165Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-42960","CVE-2026-80225","CVE-2026-85501"],"summary":"unbound: Fix of 5 CVEs","details":"- CVE-2026-42960: in scrub_normalize(), mark additional-section glue as allowed\n  only for NS rrsets in the authority section, so address records can no longer\n  be cached as a side effect of a delegation response\n- CVE-2026-80225: bound the number of pipelined queries drained from one TCP/DoT\n  connection per event-loop visit to NUM_TCP_PER_SELECT and defer the remainder\n  through a zero-delay timer, so a single connection can no longer monopolise a\n  worker event loop\n- CVE-2026-85501: add the val-validation-attempts and val-hash-attempts limits\n  (default 32 each) to bound DNSSEC signature and hash work per validation, and\n  require only the answer and authority sections to be secure\n  (reply_an_ns_rrsets_secure), so the additional section is no longer validated","affected":[{"package":{"name":"python3-unbound","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.8","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/python3-unbound?distro=almalinux-9.8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.24.2-3.el9_8.8.tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/tuxcare9.8esu/CLSA-2026-1791175484.json"}},{"package":{"name":"unbound","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.8","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/unbound?distro=almalinux-9.8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.24.2-3.el9_8.8.tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/tuxcare9.8esu/CLSA-2026-1791175484.json"}},{"package":{"name":"unbound-devel","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.8","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/unbound-devel?distro=almalinux-9.8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.24.2-3.el9_8.8.